invariant: INV-16
file: p256_wide_inverse.c
catches: test/lint-p256-wide.sh
reason: the inverse runs 16 rounds, 496 steps, where
  spec/lean/Spec/P256WideInverse.lean proves that 17 take a to zero for every
  value below 2^256. No test sees it: every value the tests and the
  differential draw takes 14 rounds or fewer. tools/p256_wide.py holds
  STEPS and ROUNDS to the model's steps and rounds.

--- old
#define ROUNDS 17
--- new
#define ROUNDS 16
